      "text": [
        "وحق الهدي أن تريد به الله عز وجل ولا تريد به خلقه ولا تريد به إلا التعرض لرحمة الله ونجاة روحك يوم تلقاه."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.william-c-chittick": [
          "The right of the offering (hady) [1] is that through it you desire God and you do not desire His creation; through it you desire only the exposure of your soul to God's mercy and the deliverance of your spirit on the day you encounter Him.."
        ]
      }
